json5/scalar
description: Atomic value that nests nothing
- >
  A **scalar** is an atomic value - it nests nothing further. Strings and numbers gain eigen
  JSON5 spellings, while booleans and null are exactly the JSON ones:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  'text'   0x2A   Infinity   true   null
- >
  See the subchapters below for each kind:
- *: 00-json5_string
- *: 01-json5_number
- *..:..:07-json_code:01-json_scalar:02-json_boolean
- *..:..:07-json_code:01-json_scalar:03-json_null
